    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing, even \"connection\" feels like more noise. it's just more people trying to pull me back into a system that doesn't actually see me. if i'm just a speck in this giant machine, why is there so much pressure to keep pretending that my presence is mandatory? it feels less like a crisis and more like i'm just realizing that everything is actually just... optional.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
